1:["$","$Ld",null,{"page":{"id":"library--writing-analysis","kind":"library-article","route":"/roadmap/library/writing-analysis","sourceUrl":"https://refold.la/roadmap/library/writing-analysis","sourceHash":"5b2f88b96c522031e152f65a85197e10ba8e79790321c376da45791acb84bdef","collectedAt":"2026-09-01T23:11:26.968Z","bodyMode":"authorized-full-body","title":{"en":"Writing Analysis","zh":"写作分析"},"description":{"en":"","zh":""},"segments":[{"id":"segment-0001","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Writing analysis means going back over something you wrote and looking for errors, awkward phrasing, and patterns of mistakes. It's the writing equivalent of <a href=\"/roadmap/library/speaking-analysis\">Speaking Analysis</a>.","zh":"写作分析是指回头检查自己写的内容，寻找错误、别扭的措辞和反复出现的错误模式。这相当于写作版的<a href=\"/roadmap/library/speaking-analysis\">口语分析</a>。"}},{"id":"methods","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Methods","zh":"方法"}},{"id":"segment-0003","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>Self-review:</strong> Reread your own writing with fresh eyes (ideally after some time has passed). Look for grammar mistakes, unnatural phrasing, and word choice issues. This builds your ability to self-edit.","zh":"<strong>自我检查：</strong>隔一段时间后，用全新的眼光重新阅读自己的文章（如果可以的话）。寻找语法错误、不自然的措辞和选词问题。这能培养你自我编辑的能力。"}},{"id":"segment-0004","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>Tutor review:</strong> Bring your writing to a lesson and go over it together. A tutor can explain <em>why</em> something is wrong, not just that it is — which is far more useful for learning. <a href=\"/roadmap/library/corrected-reading-aloud\">Corrected Reading Aloud</a>","zh":"<strong>导师检查：</strong>把你的文章带到课程中，与导师一起检查。导师不仅能指出哪里错了，还能解释<em>为什么</em>错了——这对学习要有用得多。<a href=\"/roadmap/library/corrected-reading-aloud\">修正后朗读</a>"}},{"id":"segment-0005","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<strong>AI correction:</strong> Feed your writing into an AI chatbot or grammar checker. These tools are good at catching common errors and explaining the rules. They're not perfect, but they're free or cheap and available anytime.","zh":"<strong>AI 纠错：</strong>将你的文章输入 AI 聊天机器人或语法检查器。这些工具擅长发现常见错误并解释相关规则。它们并不完美，但通常免费或价格低廉，而且随时可用。"}},{"id":"segment-0006","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"<a href=\"https://refold.la/apps/writing-tutor\">-&gt; Check out our AI Writing Tutor</a>","zh":"<a href=\"https://refold.la/apps/writing-tutor\">-&gt; 试试我们的 AI 写作导师</a>"}},{"id":"tips","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"Tips","zh":"提示"}},{"id":"segment-0008","type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"en":"Look for patterns, not individual errors. If you keep making the same verb conjugation mistake, that's a thing to study and practice.","zh":"寻找模式，而不是只看单个错误。如果你总是犯同一个动词变位错误，那就是一个值得学习和练习的方面。"},{"en":"When you find a mistake, consider mining the correct version for your flashcards.","zh":"发现错误时，可以考虑把正确版本挖掘出来，制作成闪卡。"},{"en":"Consistent writing analysis is what makes writing practice effective. Writing without reviewing is only half the exercise.","zh":"持续进行写作分析，才能让写作练习真正有效。写作而不复盘，只完成了一半的练习。"}]},{"id":"when-to-start","type":"heading","level":2,"content":{"en":"When to Start","zh":"何时开始"}},{"id":"segment-0010","type":"paragraph","content":{"en":"Writing analysis is introduced in Phase 5B and continues through Phase 7. It's especially important if you want to pass a high-level, formal test or go to school or work in the target language.","zh":"写作分析在第5B阶段引入，并持续到第7阶段。如果你想通过高阶正式考试，或想在目标语言环境中上学、工作，它尤其重要。"}}],"cards":[]}}]
